      },
      "message": "unprivileged/integrated-matrix: Rewrite microscaling for block-level scales\n\nReplace per-row/per-column microscaling with block-level scales:\n\n- Add bs field at vtype[11] to select block size (0=32, 1=16 elements)\n- Rewrite v0 scale layout: paired 16-bit elements with (scale_A, scale_B)\n  bytes, indexed by (row/col × S + block), where S = ceil(K_eff/block_size)\n- Add Zvvfmmnx* subextensions (BS=16) alongside existing Zvvfmmmx* (BS=32),\n  with LMUL restriction W × LMUL ≤ SEW for BS=16\n- Update SAIL pseudocode for all three FP instructions (vfmmacc, vfwmmacc,\n  vfqwmmacc) with block-structured inner loop and paired scale reads\n- Add fp_zero helper function declaration\n- Expand FP encoding map with separate BS=32 and BS=16 columns\n- Add capacity proof and representative configuration table\n- Cite Lee et al. (MX+, MICRO '25) motivating BS=16",
